Focus, focus.

104
00:05:15.482 --> 00:05:16.483
Kahon!

105
00:05:28.195 --> 00:05:29.563
Go, go! Naiwan sa katawan!

106
00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.631
Kaliwa sa katawan, tao!

107
00:05:31.698 --> 00:05:33.500
[contestant 2] Ituloy mo! Wag kang huminto!

108
