ay mas mahusay.

151
00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:46.399
Oo, congratulations sa iyo.

152
00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:51.638
[sa Korean] Ibalik natin ito
kapag tapos na kaming mag-film. [tumawa]

153
00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:57.010
nanalo ako.

154
00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.213
Itataas ko ang aking paningin

155
00:08:00.714 --> 00:08:03.249
at maglagay ng mas magandang laban sa susunod.

156
00:08:03.817 --> 00:08:06.052
[Jongkook] Sige,
bumalik sa Tire Brawl deathmatch.

157
00:08:08.555 --> 00:08:10.623
Ang manlalaban na papasok sa deathmatch ay...

158
00:08:11.925 --> 00:08:14.260
<i>Sigurado akong matatalo ako
kung sino man ang kapareha ko.</i>

159
00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:16.963
<i>Hindi mahalaga kung sino ito,
Kaya kong harapin ang sinuman.</i>

160
00:08:18.431 --> 00:08:19.699
Shin Donghyun.

161
00:08:19.766 --> 00:08:22.035
{\an8}Shin Donghyun. Mangyaring sumulong.

162
00:08:22.102 --> 00:08:23.570
{\an8}SHIN DONGHYUN
O*E CHAMPIONSHIP MUAY THAI FIGHTER

163
00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:29.809
Ang mandirigmang kaharap ni Shin Donghyun ay...

164
00:08:33.947 --> 00:08:35.482
Kim Hyunjun.

165
00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:37.550
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun.

166
00:08:37.617 --> 00:08:39.352
{\an8}- Ano?
- Mangyaring sumulong.

167
00:08:39.419 --> 00:08:40.687
Muay Thai laban sa Muay Thai.

168
00:08:42.188 --> 00:08:43.556
Kim Hyunjun.

169
00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:44.624
[bumuntong hininga]

170
00:08:49.763 --> 00:08:51.698
Pareho silang Muay Thai fighters.

171
