450
00:23:41.487 --> 00:23:42.521
{\an8}Yuk Junseo,

451
00:23:42.588 --> 00:23:43.822
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun,

452
00:23:43.889 --> 00:23:45.491
{\an8}at Kuk Seungjun.

453
00:23:45.557 --> 00:23:46.725
Binabati kita.

454
00:23:46.792 --> 00:23:48.594
- Binabati kita.
- Binabati kita.

455
00:23:50.462 --> 00:23:52.564
Hindi ko inaasahan na aabot ako ng ganito.

456
00:23:52.631 --> 00:23:56.468
[Junseo] <i>Kagagaling lang sa 90 fighters
