511
00:26:23.082 --> 00:26:24.483
Hindi mo naman tinakpan diba?

512
00:26:24.550 --> 00:26:26.118
Baka konti lang.

513
00:26:26.185 --> 00:26:28.287
Mukhang mabilis talaga gumaling si Junseo.

514
