- Ano ito?
- Man, ano ito?

532
00:27:08.594 --> 00:27:10.863
- [♪ upbeat jazz music na tumutugtog]
- Mukhang masarap.

533
00:27:10.929 --> 00:27:12.331
Kahanga-hanga!

534
00:27:12.397 --> 00:27:13.599
- Mukhang masarap.
- Nakakabaliw iyan.

535
00:27:13.665 --> 00:27:14.800
